# Used by `npm run build` for https://stallbook.mahaamrut.org.in — safe to commit
# (VITE_* values are baked into the public bundle, never put secrets here).
# Nginx serves dist/ and proxies /api and /uploads to the backend on :4200,
# so the API is same-origin. The admin panel lives at /admin in the same build.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
